# Scripted input for compose_window_pointer.kt's window (KLIO_WIN_INPUT): an
# event as the platform would report it, at the given milliseconds after the
# window's first event poll.
# The secondary, tertiary and primary buttons on the first box.
100ms move 20 20
100ms press 20 20 2
100ms release 20 20 2
150ms press 20 20 3
150ms release 20 20 3
200ms press 20 20 1
200ms release 20 20 1
# A double click on the second box: its two presses more than the 40 ms a
# double click's presses must be apart, and well within its 300 ms.
250ms move 20 120
250ms press 20 120
250ms release 20 120
350ms press 20 120
350ms release 20 120
# A drag from the third box.
500ms move 10 210
500ms press 10 210
550ms move 30 220
600ms move 60 250
650ms release 60 250
